eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/580820/extras/a87869c6f341c04436058a7de1fca191.webp?t=1669230668\" width=620 height=12 /></span><br><br><strong>Play on your Steam Deck too!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/580820/extras/27cddb3c6979675dcf0cc8d8acede2d7.avif?t=1669230668\" width=600 height=250 /></span>",
